governance/review-reports/code-推送閘接漂移檢查/r3-外家否決-codex.stdout:6293:   - `_DR_RANGE` 由 git 給的 sha 與 `git merge-base` 輸出組成,以單一引號化參數傳給 `--diff`。裡面不會出現以 `-` 開頭的值。
governance/review-reports/code-推送閘接漂移檢查/r3-外家否決-codex.stdout:6312:severity: minor
governance/review-reports/code-推送閘接漂移檢查/r3-外家否決-codex.stdout:6318:## F1 遠端宣告的預設分支排在本地過期的 main/master upstream 之後,舊 master 會劫持起點
governance/review-reports/code-推送閘接漂移檢查/r3-外家否決-codex.stdout:6319:severity: minor
